The shadcn look of the styling skill (website/src/looks/shadcn/, its examples in
website/src/examples/*/shadcn/, and their copies in
packages/menhir/skills/menhir-styling/looks/shadcn/) reproduces class strings
and token values from shadcn/ui, under the licence in that look's LICENSE file.

The Bootstrap look of the styling skill (website/src/looks/bootstrap/, its
examples in website/src/examples/*/bootstrap/, and their copies in
packages/menhir/skills/menhir-styling/looks/bootstrap/) reproduces declarations
and token values from Bootstrap, under the licence in that look's LICENSE file.
